  "title": "rtcp: Add RTPFB and XR to the RTCP dissector heuristic",
  "description": "This MR is authored by my coworker Nico Cvitak (ncvitak@apple.com)\n\nThe [RFC 5506](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5506) Reduced-Size RTCP \"allows any RTCP packet type\" to be sent without need for compounding with a SR or RR packet as originally described in [RFC 3550](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3550) RTP.\n\nFor \"Feedback\" and \"Status Reports\" use cases, RTPFB and XR should be added to the RTCP dissector heuristic.\n\n##### Before \n\n![3a3df1d9-d63e-406c-8ee5-30ade2dfb0ca.png](/uploads/594a70213963f5126243546c0d1f3416/3a3df1d9-d63e-406c-8ee5-30ade2dfb0ca.png)\n\n##### After \n\n![154e59fd-323a-43b6-9d83-afc0027ac217.png](/uploads/93b4dff0978ae432e88609d043f52721/154e59fd-323a-43b6-9d83-afc0027ac217.png)\n\n##### Test file\n\n[rtcp_rtpfb_xr_heuristic.pcapng.gz](/uploads/46dd408a65ffb1bcac91ec1f9912b591/rtcp_rtpfb_xr_heuristic.pcapng.gz)",
